### Pro Tip for GitHub & Your Resume

When naming the project on your resume or GitHub repository, pair the product name with a solid tagline so recruiters immediately see the backend complexity:

* **Repo/Project Title:** `ForeSight — Predictive Attendance & Eligibility Engine`
* **Resume Headline:** *Predictive Attendance Analytics API built with Flask, JWT Authentication, and Schedule Forecasting Algorithms.*

